# The build tree. 342 MB of object files, the deployed Qt DLLs and the MSVC
# runtime, every byte of it reproducible from the sources beside this file -
# see the build recipe in the notes. Nothing in here belongs in the history.
build/
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.res

# qmake and Qt Creator leavings. The Makefiles are GENERATED from BurnOS.pro,
# and a committed one goes stale the moment somebody adds a source file - which
# is exactly the stale Makefile link error that has already cost a morning.
Makefile
Makefile.Debug
Makefile.Release
*.user
*.user.*
.qmake.stash
.qtcreator/
debug/
release/
object_script.*

# Generated by moc, uic and rcc.
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
moc_predefs.h
ui_*.h
qrc_*.cpp

# Logs. burnos-live.log is the app's own running commentary and build.log is
# whatever jom last printed; both are written on every run.
*.log

# The models are DOWNLOADED on first run by installer.cpp, deliberately, and
# they are hundreds of megabytes. They must never be committed.
models/
parakeet-streaming/
*.onnx
*.bin
*.gguf
*.wav

# The agent's own session notes, written into whatever folder it works in.
SENTRI-MEMORY.md
